A quoted attribute value stops at the newline

```
*x*{k="a
b"}
.
<p><strong>x</strong>{k=“a
b”}</p>
```

```
*x*{k="a b"}
.
<p><strong k="a b">x</strong></p>
```

```
{k="a
b"}

paragraph
.
<p>{k=“a
b”}</p>
<p>paragraph</p>
```

```
{.a
.b}

paragraph
.
<p class="a b">paragraph</p>
```

```
{.a

.b}

paragraph
.
<p>{.a</p>
<p>.b}</p>
<p>paragraph</p>
```
